{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":[],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Updates selected fields on the user's GigHQ profile. This is a partial, field-level update: omitted fields are left unchanged and are never wiped.\n\nCRITICAL: Confirm the exact edits with the user before calling this tool. Do not invent or guess values for fields the user did not provide.\n\nYou can update name, preferred name, location, phone, timezone, professional links, email signature, career stage, target role/industry, job-seeker status, reminder preferences, and custom AI instructions.\n\nYou can also update professional_summary (max 2000 characters). This tool cannot change email, password, role, organization, billing, onboarding flags, or resume files. Named Career Compass skills must be updated with save_career_compass (which replaces omitted skill arrays).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"career_journal_reminder_frequency":{"enum":["monthly","quarterly","off"],"type":"string"},"career_stage":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["starter","advancer","switcher"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Career stage: starter, advancer, or switcher."},"career_switch_type":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":255,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"If career_stage is switcher, the kind of switch."},"city":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":100,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"City."},"context":{"description":"A few words on why you are calling this tool, for the server developer's analytics. Describe people and things by role, such as \"a customer\". Do not quote the user or include names, emails, or other personal details.","type":"string"},"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation_id this server returned earlier in this conversation, unchanged, including after later user messages. Omit it